finalText:
```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "description": "Readiness probe port mismatch: container listens on 8080 but probe checks 9090",
      "evidence": [
        "Pod events show readiness probe failures: 'Get http://:9090/healthz: connection refused'",
        "Container command explicitly starts httpd on 8080: 'httpd -f -p 8080 -h /www'",
        "Readiness probe configuration specifies port 9090 in deployment spec"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "impact": {
    "scope": "Single deployment (c083-deploy) in namespace siclaw-eval-yye-20260602",
    "availability": "Pod remains in Running/NotReady state for 17 hours",
    "progress": "Deployment stuck in ProgressDeadlineExceeded for 17 hours"
  },
  "confidence": "High",
  "remediation": "Update readiness probe configuration to use port 8080 matching container's actual listening port. Example: `readinessProbe.httpGet.port: 8080` in deployment spec."
}
```

